Description: DxPower provides methodology for sample size determination and 
    power evaluation in confirmatory studies with co-primary endpoints. 
    The package is designed to support binary and continuous outcomes, 
    including diagnostic accuracy measures such as sensitivity and 
    specificity. It accommodates superiority and non-inferiority 
    hypotheses and combination testing strategies within an 
    intersection-union testing framework. The methods are based on 
    asymptotic theory and are structured to allow flexible extension 
    to additional endpoint types and study objectives.
